lines sail the Douro from Porto?","a":"Seven confirmed — Viking, AmaWaterways, Avalon, CroisiEurope, Scenic, Emerald and Uniworld — because Porto is the single embarkation gateway for the ~8-day run up to Regua, Pinhao and the Spanish border.","source":"cruisecritic.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"What''s the difference between Port and Douro wine?","a":"Both come from the same Alto Douro terraces, but Port is fortified and aged in the Vila Nova de Gaia lodges (an 18th-century tradition), while Douro DOC is unfortified table wine — taste both, one at a Gaia lodge, one at a valley quinta.","source":"whc.unesco.org","si_tag":"culinary"},{"q":"Where should I stay for a luxury Douro base?","a":"Two anchors: Six Senses Douro Valley, a restored 19th-century manor with a vineyard-heritage spa, for the valley itself; or The Yeatman above the Gaia Port lodges — 109 terraced river-view rooms, a two-Michelin-star table and a Caudalie Vinotherapie spa.","source":"scottdunn.com","si_tag":"ultra"},{"q":"Is the Douro good for a honeymoon?","a":"Yes — a quiet, high-romance wine landscape: a river-view quinta suite, a private terrace over the vines at sunset, and a Michelin dinner across from Porto''s lit Ribeira. It reads couples, not crowds.","source":"the-yeatman-hotel.com","si_tag":"romance"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Douro Valley Travel Guide: River Cruises, Port Wine, the UNESCO Terraces & Porto","meta_description":"Plan Portugal''s Douro Valley — TravelWell''s second great river-cruise anchor: 7 cruise lines from Porto, the UNESCO Alto Douro terraces, the home of Port, The Yeatman''s two Michelin stars, Six Senses Douro Valley.","slug":"douro-valley-portugal","primary_keyword":"Douro Valley travel guide","long_tail":["Douro river cruise from Porto 2026","Alto Douro UNESCO wine region","Port wine Vila Nova de Gaia lodges","The Yeatman two Michelin stars","Six Senses Douro Valley","Pinhao Regua quinta tasting"],"search_language":"pt-PT","local_keywords":["Vale do Douro","cruzeiro no D